<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Running like a fugitive,</font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">isoi de iru</font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">being chased by something.</font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kawai ta mune ga</font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">Inside my heart is pounding,</font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">kari tateru no sa</font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#d1e5f3">my throat dry like it's withering.</font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no tame de naku</font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">For no single one,</font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">dare no mono de naku</font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">to none does belong,</font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">ore tachi no ima ga</font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#eff4ef">this time is ours, right now...</font></b></font></font>

19
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:53,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">itami hodoki kokoro hodoki kage o hodoki</font></b></font></font>

20
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:53,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Unraveling the pain, unraveling our hearts, unraveling shadows.</font></b></font></font>

21
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">iki o tsunete hashiri nukero yami o saite</font></b></font></font>

22
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">Stifling our breath, reaching for beyond, tearing through the dark.</font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:55,170 --> 00:01:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such intensity...</font>

32
00:01:58,050 --> 00:02:03,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I take a breath or move my eyes
I will be marked and killed-</font>

33
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's what I'm feeling..</font>

34
00:02:05,810 --> 00:02:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I'm stuck like this for an hour,
I'll go mad.</font>

35
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Facing a Jonin intent to kill...</font>

36
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This sensation is like having
my life held in limbo...</font>

37
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! I'd rather die
to escape this feeling!</font>

38
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

39
00:02:27,580 --> 00:02:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry. I'll protect
you all with my life.</font>

40
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely won't allow
my comrades to get killed.</font>

41
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that...</font>

42
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

43
00:03:24,510 --> 00:03:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei! Behind you!!</font>

44
00:03:30,770 --> 00:03:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!!</font>

45
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Water Clone Jutsu...?</font>

46
00:03:46,990 --> 00:03:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be.</font>

47
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move!</font>

48
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:06,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Determination</font>

49
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:06,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"> Vowed to the Pain</font>

50
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

51
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow!!</font>

52
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you say it's over?</font>

53
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't understand, do you?</font>

54
00:04:39,710 --> 00:04:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to beat me
just by making like a monkey...</font>

55
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No chance.</font>

56
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, I must say you're good.</font>

57
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:59,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Water Clone Jutsu was
being copied at that point...</font>

58
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely won't allow
my comrades to get killed.</font>

59
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By letting the clone talk as if it were you,</font>

60
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you succeeded in distracting me.</font>

61
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you used Hidden Mist Jutsu
to hide yourself to see what I was doing...</font>

62
00:05:23,130 --> 00:05:24,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

63
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not a fool.</font>

64
00:05:29,970 --> 00:05:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That one was a fake too!</font>

65
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

66
00:05:51,490 --> 00:05:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Makibishi spikes...!</font>

67
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How foolish...!</font>

68
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

69
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I can't believe that
Kakashi-sensei got...</font>

70
00:06:05,010 --> 00:06:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">kicked away like that...</font>

71
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Taijutsu skills are also
extremely good.</font>

72
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with this water...?
It's awfully heavy.</font>

73
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... Fool!</font>

74
00:06:21,610 --> 00:06:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the Water Prison Jutsu!</font>

75
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

76
00:06:27,150 --> 00:06:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My temporary escape
into the water...</font>

77
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was a huge mistake!</font>

78
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're caught...</font>

79
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a special prison that makes
it impossible for you to escape!</font>

80
00:06:38,790 --> 00:06:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes things harder
having you able to act.</font>

81
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... Kakashi.</font>

82
00:06:45,050 --> 00:06:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to settle things
with you later.</font>

83
00:06:48,050 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I will finish those guys off.</font>

84
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Clone Jutsu...</font>

85
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't expect this level of skill...</font>

86
00:07:09,490 --> 00:07:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're acting big,
wearing a headband like a Ninja...</font>

87
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:17,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... a real Ninja is one</font>

88
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:21,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has hovered between
life and death numerous times.</font>

89
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

90
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:26,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only those who are worth being listed
in my Bingo Book</font>

91
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">deserve to be called Ninja.</font>

92
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys like you can't be
called real Ninja.</font>

93
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's disappeared again!</font>

94
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just a kid!</font>

95
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:50,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

96
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You three! Take Tazuna-san and run!</font>

97
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no chance
against this guy!</font>

98
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as he has me trapped
in this Water Prison,</font>

99
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he won't be able
to move from here.</font>

100
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he shouldn't be able to use
the Water Clone Jutsu</font>

101
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if he's far enough away
from his real body.</font>

102
00:08:08,050 --> 00:08:09,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, just run for now!</font>

103
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run away?</font>

104
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:13,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got to be kidding me.</font>

105
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That option was gone
from the moment you got caught.</font>

106
00:08:19,350 --> 00:08:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we ran,</font>

107
00:08:20,930 --> 00:08:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without you, sooner or later
we'd be defeated by Zabuza...</font>

108
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we'd all be destroyed.</font>

109
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we were to reform
the Manji defense,</font>

110
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would be impossible
to block his attacks.</font>

111
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end...</font>

112
00:08:35,820 --> 00:08:37,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll have...</font>

113
00:08:37,830 --> 00:08:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no options left.</font>

114
00:08:39,790 --> 00:08:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order for us to survive,
our only option is to rescue you.</font>

115
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll just have to do it!</font>

116
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There...!</font>

117
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too easy.</font>

118
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

119
00:09:14,570 --> 00:09:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

120
00:09:19,450 --> 00:09:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is the Jonin level...
A real Ninja...</font>

121
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:26,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've got to run...
At this rate...</font>

122
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seriously...! Seriously...!</font>

123
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be killed!!</font>

124
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:53,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to swear on
the pain of my left hand!</font>

125
00:09:55,610 --> 00:10:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never get into another situation
from which I'll have to be rescued...</font>

126
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never be afraid or
be a coward.</font>

127
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:09,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt... scaredy cat?</font>

128
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to Sasuke.</font>

129
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I borrow that
Leaf headband for a while?</font>

130
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This?</font>

131
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is worn only by those who have
graduated from Ninja Academy.</font>

132
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, come over here.
I'd like to give you something.</font>

133
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations on your graduation.</font>

134
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because you're
all squirts</font>

135
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who don't have the qualifications
to become Ninja.</font>

136
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missions are all risky assignments.</font>

137
00:10:58,630 --> 00:10:59,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pass!</font>

138
00:11:00,090 --> 00:11:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not that little prankster
that you think I am!</font>

139
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to surpass the Hokage!</font>

140
00:11:08,850 --> 00:11:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so I'm going to get
the entire Village</font>

141
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to acknowledge my existence!</font>

142
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

143
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a Ninja now. And...</font>

144
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I decided that I was not going
to run anymore!</font>

145
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I wouldn't run away...!</font>

146
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:32,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You fool! Stop it!</font>

147
00:11:33,170 --> 00:11:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Naruto! What are you thinking?!</font>

148
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! Fool...</font>

149
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you thinking...
charging off on your own?!</font>

150
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Sasuke-kun is no match for him...</font>

151
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how hard we try,
we Genin are no match for him...</font>

152
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?!</font>

153
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:19,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The headband...?!</font>

154
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You, with no brows...</font>

155
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:45,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Record in your Bingo Book...</font>

156
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the man who will one day
become the Leaf Village's Hokage.</font>

157
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf-style Ninja...</font>

158
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto!!</font>

159
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

160
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I first saw that little kid,
he seemed so unreliable...</font>

161
00:13:13,770 --> 00:13:16,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! Lend me your ear!</font>

162
00:13:16,650 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

163
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a plan.</font>

164
00:13:20,730 --> 00:13:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to discuss plans
under these circumstances...?</font>

165
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:24,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...!</font>

166
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!
You are talking of teamwork?</font>

167
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is this feeling...?</font>

168
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was Naruto so...?</font>

169
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now...</font>

170
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get wild...</font>

171
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let's get wild!</font>

172
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such loud snorting,
but do you have a winning plan?</font>

173
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This isn't good...</font>

174
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:31,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you guys doing!
I told you to run!</font>

175
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was obvious what was going to happen
once I was caught!</font>

176
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry! Run!</font>

177
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen to me!
Our mission is to protect Tazuna-san!</font>

178
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you forgotten that?!</font>

179
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man...</font>

180
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

181
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a seed that I planted...</font>

182
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't say that
I want my life to be spared.</font>

183
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, you guys...</font>

184
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight as much as you want!</font>

185
00:15:06,590 --> 00:15:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You hear that?</font>

186
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you ready?</font>

187
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys really haven't learned
anything, have you?</font>

188
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:24,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?!</font>

189
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still playing at being Ninja?</font>

190
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I was your age,</font>

191
00:15:32,530 --> 00:15:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this hand was already
stained red with blood!</font>

192
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza, the Demon!</font>

193
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...? It seems that
you've heard of me.</font>

194
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago, in the Mist Village,
often called the town of Blood Mist,</font>

195
00:15:52,930 --> 00:15:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja candidates faced
their biggest hurdle.</font>

196
00:15:58,770 --> 00:16:01,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you also know about
that graduation exam...</font>

197
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That graduation exam?</font>

198
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it...?</font>

199
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This graduation exam
that you're talking about...</font>

200
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:18,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The students killed each other.</font>

201
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

202
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Classmates who had shared rice
from the same pot</font>

203
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">formed pairs and tried
to kill each other.</font>

204
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It didn't end
until one of them died.</font>

205
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partners who used to talk about
each other's dreams and aspirations...</font>

206
00:16:42,890 --> 00:16:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How cruel...</font>

207
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ten years ago,</font>

208
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:51,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Mist Village's graduation exam
was forced to undergo drastic reform.</font>

209
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was because an evil demon
had appeared on the scene the previous year.</font>

210
00:17:03,790 --> 00:17:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reform?</font>

211
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about the reform?</font>

212
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What had that evil demon done?</font>

213
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With no scruples or hesitation...</font>

214
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a young boy who didn't even have
the qualifications for being a Ninja,</font>

215
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">annihilated over a hundred examinees.</font>

216
00:17:37,530 --> 00:17:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sure was... fun...</font>

217
00:17:55,130 --> 00:17:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

218
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

219
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

220
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

221
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah... Shadow Clone Jutsu,
and there are quite a few of them.</font>

222
00:18:54,190 --> 00:18:55,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

223
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible, after all...</font>

224
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that
you can defeat the guy!</font>

225
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is only one way left
to defeat this guy!</font>

226
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

227
00:19:33,190 --> 00:19:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

228
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's your plan, Naruto!</font>

229
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's pretty good for you!</font>

230
00:19:52,870 --> 00:19:54,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Wind Shuriken,</font>

231
00:19:54,630 --> 00:19:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Windmill of Shadows...</font>

232
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:07,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shuriken won't work on me.</font>

233
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. This time
it's aiming for my real body...</font>

234
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

235
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not so easy!</font>

236
00:20:34,790 --> 00:20:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shuriken in
the Shuriken's shadow...!</font>

237
00:20:37,460 --> 00:20:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...
The Shadow Shuriken Jutsu!</font>

238
00:20:41,670 --> 00:20:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A second Shuriken
in his blind spot!</font>

239
00:20:54,270 --> 00:20:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

240
00:20:56,730 --> 00:20:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still too naive...</font>

241
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He dodged it!!</font>

242
00:21:14,210 --> 00:21:16,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is!</font>

243
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

244
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

245
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

246
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

247
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

248
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

249
00:21:57,190 --> 00:22:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

250
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

251
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

252
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

253
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

254
00:22:14,370 --> 00:22:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

255
00:22:27,340 --> 00:22:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

256
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

257
00:22:34,060 --> 00:22:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

258
00:22:37,390 --> 00:22:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

259
00:22:41,020 --> 00:22:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

260
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

261
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

262
00:22:52,470 --> 00:22:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yes! The plan worked!!</font>

263
00:22:54,890 --> 00:22:58,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That Zabuza had no clue
as to what I was thinking,</font>

264
00:22:58,730 --> 00:23:00,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and I fooled him!</font>

265
00:23:01,730 --> 00:23:03,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Ninja must be able
to see through the obvious.</font>

266
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Did you see that – the Leaf-style fighting
of Uzumaki Naruto?!</font>

267
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Kakashi-sensei,
the rest is up to you.</font>

268
00:23:11,410 --> 00:23:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Kakashi the Sharingan User."</font>

269
00:23:13,830 --> 00:23:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm going to kick butt once again!</font>

